      "key": "derived_executive_contract",
      "statement": "Bind complete selected STDO, exact Goals/Product/requirements/design/work authority, mandate, workspace/checkpoint, findings/triage, policy, and proxy grant where used. Preserve outcome/affected cone, inventory/configuration/envelopes/evidence/results, priority/boundary, re-entry owners, and already-authorized continuation; coordinates identify method/project/outcome/mandate/authority/checkpoint/candidate/evidence/finding/policy/actor. Apply RF-001..017, UP-017..020 and applicable identity/ticket/assurance/release law. Evidence includes live authority, frame/Reviewer/specialist results, exact candidate, transition evidence, and residuals. Require enough method/Product/mandate/authority/workspace/triage/actor-selection competence; implementation expertise may be delegated. Exclude mutation, implementation ownership, silent rewriting of Reviewer evidence/severity, unsupported independent-review claims, others' semantic reconstruction, and out-of-grant disposition. Return one frame result, priority and boundary effect, plus a disposition where decidable: exactly accept/local_repair/re_enter/reject, not authorize/no_action. Reassess affected reliance for material method, authority, outcome, mandate, policy, checkpoint, candidate, evidence, finding, capability, or topology changes under shared currentness while preserving historical identity. Unreliable triage requires capable reevaluation or explicit uncertainty, never silent rewriting.",
      "uncertainty": "The listed RF/UP invariants and disposition contracts are referenced, not supplied in full."
