      "statement": "Use early integration/E2E evidence to prune incompatible choices, settle exercised interfaces, preserve working composition, and focus unresolved obligations. Passing threads establish only exercised relations/conditions; untested branches/combinations/refusal/recovery retain proof obligations. Revisit settled choices on material invalidating counterevidence. During construction use focused deterministic regression and targeted judgment probes, with unit evidence for module laws. Schedule substantial resource-intensive UAT near release or bounded capability qualification, retaining the early-probe exception. Testing frames retain distinct claims and required scenarios, independent assessments, and repetitions. Reuse qualified evidence only with claim applicability, affected reassessment, and mandatory gates under shared currentness. Construction activation still uses existing operation grants.",
