      "key": "derived_worker_contract",
      "statement": "Use sufficient UP-020 intake and accepted UP-017..019 design-to-execution basis where applicable, preserving every complete selected method/project relation material to the cone. Authority covers bounded construction/transformation and self-review only. Mutation requires exact inherited owner grant, subject, and territory; missing, ambiguous, or out-of-territory authority refuses the effect. Exclude upstream semantic change, unauthorized cone growth, self-acceptance, hidden competing paths, admission/publication/independent acceptance/frame-set revision/inferred next action, and advancement after return. Return one frame result and exactly one work-result variant. candidate_ready binds exact candidate and required transition evidence, not accept; green tests support only relations actually exercised by production/test semantics. Material intake/basis/checkpoint/dependency/configuration/capability/topology change triggers affected-reliance reassessment. Read the complete causal cone within access grant even beyond write territory; narrow writes cannot excuse omitting material producers/consumers/owners. Return out-of-territory repair to its owner without effect.",
