      "key": "derived_reviewer_contract",
      "statement": "Apply RF-001..017, UP-020/007/022, and relevant Product/design/identity/release law. Review access grants bounded evaluation only, never construction/transformation/admission/publication/mutation/decision/disposition/next activation. Exclude candidate edits, repairs, priority or release/MVP disposition, next-action selection, Worker-summary substitution, assurance-owned semantic reconstruction, unbound evidence flattening, and silent scope growth. Return one frame result with findings/counterexamples/supportable triage/residuals sufficient for authorized Executive decisions where decidable. Reassess affected reliance on material candidate/authority/basis/evidence population/severity scale/dependency/configuration/scope/independence change. UP-007 owns required review and traceability; UP-022 owns assurance/freeze; this adds no universal review round or independence test. Assessment stays distinct from disposition. Unsupported cause/blast radius/workaround/risk remains uncertain. Review test code/fixtures/mutations/environment/interpretation whenever they can affect proof; passing tests cannot substitute. Findings and retained guards/predicates require violated property, supported entry/state, governing operating/threat model, and credible causal path. Excluded threats alone do not justify retention; broader models re-enter their owner. Internal location is not trust; hypothetical hostility is not applicability. Retain actual model-required untrusted-input, mutable-state, authority, and effect checks. Suggested repair becomes obligation only through its owner.",
